{"parentUuid":"20dc72bf-834f-4156-8e4c-c61265d81a3b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cde3ECEqw5DzenaFVMUXd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WGCXk4opmLQ6uTLrS6gPJ5","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"30 of the 425 asks on disk carry a multiSelect question, where the widget wants space-to-toggle then enter. How should the phone drive that?","header":"multiSelect","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"One tap = one toggle, then a separate done (Recommended)","description":"Tapping an option sends 'step to it + space' and nothing else. The next poll re-reads the pane, which paints the toggle state per row, so the phone renders checked options as checked from the screen rather than from local memory. A separate 'done' button sends enter. Consistent with the completion model you just chose: every step is verified against a fresh pane read and nothing compounds. Costs a 4s poll per toggle."},{"label":"Collect locally, send one sequence","description":"The phone tracks which options you ticked and, on 'done', sends the whole script: step, space, step, space, enter. One round trip and no poll latency between taps, which matters when you are ticking three of four options. But it is the scripted model you rejected for completion, with the same property: an intermediate state that is never re-read, so one dropped keystroke silently mis-toggles everything after it."},{"label":"Send multiSelect to free text","description":"Render the options read-only and answer through the widget's 'Type something.' row in prose. No toggle arithmetic at all, and multiSelect stops being a distinct code path. But it converts a structured answer into text the receiving Claude has to re-interpret, and 30 of 425 is frequent enough that this would be a visible downgrade rather than an edge case."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1054,"cache_read_input_tokens":86598,"output_tokens":922,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1054,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":922,"cache_read_input_tokens":86598,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1054,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1054},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cde3E9iYLkYMv5Huon7JX","type":"assistant","uuid":"5cc88661-eeb5-42a0-bdab-a9cb0b496a7c","timestamp":"2026-08-02T13:57:57.382Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"ac51fb45-c07b-4234-8a47-f64567a6ecc0","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/skandallu/projects/claude-launcher","sessionId":"ac51fb45-c07b-4234-8a47-f64567a6ecc0","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main"}
